# This repository publishes one thing: the GitHub Pages site in docs/, which serves
# 8 Ball's privacy policy and support page. The app's source is deliberately not
# tracked here — the repo is public, and the pages need none of it.
#
# So: ignore everything, then add docs/ back. To version the source too, delete this
# file and write a normal .gitignore (build/, *.xcodeproj, .DS_Store).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**

# Finder litter, which would otherwise be published alongside the pages.
.DS_Store
